// Shared, deterministic source fixture for NGU Idle.
//
// NGU Idle is a Unity 5.6.3p2 Mono build that is **not in-sandbox** (Windows-only,
// no Steam client, no Assembly-CSharp.dll), so unlike Cookie Clicker there is no
// first-party code artifact to read. Two lanes supply the numbers:
//
//   * artifact  — gmiclotte/gear-optimizer's datamined item DB (`data/Items.js`,
//                 generated by that repo's `gatherItems.py`/`decode.py` from the
//                 game save). Cached at reference/ngu-idle/Items.js and parsed
//                 verbatim. This is the only fetchable datamined file.
//   * transcribe — the Fandom wiki. Every page here is cached as raw `action=parse`
//                 JSON (and a `.wiki` extraction) under reference/ngu-idle/.
//
// Nothing in this file or in extract-tables.mjs hits the network or reads a clock;
// re-running reproduces the CSVs byte-for-byte.
